<section id="story" class="story section-space" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="section-caption">
    <span>OUR STORY</span>
  </div>
  <h2 id="story-title" class="editorial-title" data-reveal>
    We shared a campus.<br />
    <em>Then we found each other.</em>
  </h2>
  <div class="story-grid">
    <div class="story-copy">
      <p class="lead">
        The person we would marry was at the same university. We just hadn’t met
        yet.
      </p>
      <p>
        At VIT-AP University, Plabini was one year senior to Swarnimam. We had
        friends in common and a campus in common, but somehow, never a
        conversation.
      </p>
      <p>
        It took a new city to change that. After the pandemic, Swarnimam moved
        to Bangalore for his first job. Plabini was already there, and through
        close mutual friends, she became one of the first people he got to know.
      </p>
      <p>What college never quite managed, Bangalore made easy.</p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="paths"
      data-path-scene
      aria-label="From Aliganj and Rourkela, our paths met in Bangalore"
    >
      <div class="path-origins">
        <span>ALIGANJ<small>Swarnimam</small> </span>
        <span>ROURKELA<small>Plabini</small> </span>
      </div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 240" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path
          class="path-base"
          d="M50 5C50 145 200 45 200 230M350 5C350 145 200 45 200 230"></path>
        <path class="draw-path" pathLength="1" d="M50 5C50 145 200 45 200 230"
        ></path>
        <path
          class="draw-path second"
          pathLength="1"
          d="M350 5C350 145 200 45 200 230"></path>
        <circle cx="200" cy="230" r="5"></circle>
      </svg>
      <p>BANGALORE<small>Where our story began.</small></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="city-scene" data-scroll-scene>
    <div class="city-type" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>A new city.</span>
      <em>A familiar feeling.</em>
    </div>
    <div class="city-moments">
      <p>
        <span>THE PLACES</span>A city to discover together.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span>THE PLANS</span>Food trails. Films. Time for one another.
      </p>
      <p>
        <span>THE FEELING</span>Somewhere along the way, it became us.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="city-caption">
      There were food outings, evenings at the movies and all the little
      discoveries that make a new city your own. We laughed, wandered and grew
      closer. What began as friendship became the part of our lives we couldn’t
      imagine doing without.
    </p>
    <svg
      class="city-lines"
      viewBox="0 0 800 500"
      fill="none"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      <path d="M-100 100C400 -50 100 600 900 300"></path>
      <path d="M-100 140C450 0 150 650 900 340"></path>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <p class="story-turn" data-reveal>
    By the time we talked about forever,<br />
    <em>we had already found it in the everyday.</em>
  </p>
</section>
